        <span style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">🔒</span>
        <span>Words are selected using <code style="font-family:'Fira Code',monospace; font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--text-primary);">crypto.getRandomValues()</code> — fully client-side. Your passphrase never leaves your device.</span>
      </div>
